{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から12月ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやい\n1年ってはやい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついこの間、君の名は希望を\nNHKホールで紅白という舞台に\nたった気持ちです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから1年経って\n2016年の紅白歌合戦にも\n乃木坂46は出演させてもらえることに\nなりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて、嬉しいことなんだ！\nなんて、素晴らしいことなんだ！\nなんて、幸せなことなんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年は君の名は希望を歌ってる間\n緊張でよく覚えてないので\n今年の紅白歌合戦では\nちゃんと確実に目の前の光景を\n目にやきつけておこう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/03/9235386/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/03/9235386/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんと井上さんが\n楽しそうにしてるのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人かまってもらえず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュンとしてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/03/9235386/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスライブまでも残り数日。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年クリスマスライブは、\nSHOWみたいなことをして